# Adapted from Polestar's guide forever/alliance/07-thousand-needles (GPL-3.0, github.com/fitzforge/polestar, revision 08536e3, with the fixes of the same guide up to tag v0.3.4).
# Changes: guide id, title, next guide, group notes. Quest steps kept as Polestar wrote them,
# except where a comment marked "Groupe Alliance" says otherwise.
guide groupe-alliance/11-mille-pointes
title Group 9 · Thousand Needles, Duskwood & Wetlands
folder Group Alliance
faction Alliance
levels 27-30
zone Thousand Needles
next groupe-alliance/10-site-de-fouilles

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Look to the Stars (181), The Weathered Grave (225).
# Left out for the level (their targets or ground over level + 2 here, and no later visit that fits): Hardened Shells (1105), Load Lightening (1176), A Bump in the Road (1175).

step The Missing Diplomat
  zone Stormwind City
  when level>=28
  tip Level 28 required: below 28, skip it and its follow-ups in Duskwood. Take the Deeprun Tram from Ironforge, then the Cathedral and the Keep.
  accept 1274                             -- Thomas, in the Cathedral of Light
  turnin 1274                             -- Bishop DeLavey
  accept 1241

step Jorgen and Elling Trias
  zone Stormwind City
  when onquest 1241
  turnin 1241                             -- Jorgen
  accept 1242
  turnin 1242                             -- Elling Trias, the cheese shop in the Trade District
  accept 1243

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Gnomeregan (Group 10b, 10b-gnomeregan) is asked here, once (`when group
# 2928`), at its only quest giver outside Ironforge and Dun Morogh: Shoni the Shilent's quest has
# to be in the log before the run (its Robo-mechanical Guts drop only for players on it).
step Stormwind: Shoni the Shilent (Gnomeregan, optional)
  when group 2928
  when level<33
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Gnomeregan: the gnomes' fallen city under Dun Morogh, a 5-player dungeon, levels 25 to 34. The guide runs it after Group 10 (Group 10b), from Ironforge, where the other quests are given. Shoni's quest is the only one given elsewhere: take it now. Alone? Skip it: Group 10b is then skipped too.
  note Shoni the Shilent stands in the Dwarven District, by the tram. The quest waits in the log until Gnomeregan.
  accept 2928                             -- Shoni the Shilent

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0 (review): Tinkmaster Overspark (2923), Brother Sarno's errand to the
# Gnomeregan quest giver in Tinker Town (Polestar's Forever data; Warcraft Tavern's Forever quest
# guide, 11/11/2026: "Chain Start: Brother Sarno"). Taken here, where the guide already is,
# and handed in at the start of Group 10b.
step Stormwind: Brother Sarno (Gnomeregan, optional)
  when group 2928
  when level<33
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Brother Sarno stands in Cathedral Square. His errand leads to Tinkmaster Overspark in Tinker Town, who gives Save Techbot's Brain!: a few hundred XP for a trip the guide makes anyway.
  accept 2923                             -- Brother Sarno

step Duskwood
  zone Duskwood
  note Everyone at their own pace: what you already did ticks itself, the guide picks up where you are. Playing together? Group XP is best within 4 levels.
  goto 74.8,44.2 "Duskwood"

step Watcher Backus
  zone Duskwood
  when onquest 1243
  turnin 1243                             -- Watcher Backus, at the north entrance of town; walks around Darkshire: look inside the circle on the map
  accept 1244

step Darkshire
  zone Duskwood
  sethome "Darkshire" npc 6790            -- Innkeeper Trelayne, Scarlet Raven Tavern
  buy 4371 x1 npc 3133 optional           -- Bronze Tube, from Herble Baubbletump, if you have none
  accept 58                               -- Commander Althea Ebonlocke
  turnin 174                              -- Viktori Prism'Antras, at the east end of town; inside
  accept 175

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Worgen

step Nightbane Shadow Weavers
  tip The worgen hold the woods of Brightwood, west of Darkshire and north of the road. Pull them one at a time.
  kill 533 quest 173                      -- Nightbane Shadow Weaver

step Calor
  turnin 173
  accept 221

step Nightbane Dark Runners
  tip The Dark Runners prowl the woods south of the road, west of Darkshire.
  kill 205 quest 221                      -- Nightbane Dark Runner

step Calor
  turnin 221
  accept 222

step Blind Mary
  tip Her house stands on the hill south-east of Darkshire.
  turnin 175                          -- Inside
  accept 177

step Nightbane Vile Fangs and the Insane Ghoul
  tip The strongest worgen roam the woods south of Darkshire, west and south of the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery. The Insane Ghoul hides in the small crypt by the cemetery.
  tip Careful: Curse of Blood lasts 10 minutes and adds 13 to each hit of physical damage you take.
  tip Careful: Some worgen outside the cave stand in groups, including one camp of four. To avoid adds, pull them one at a time from the raised ground next to the cave entrance.
  collect 1946 quest 177                  -- Mary's Looking Glass; inside
  kill 206 quest 222                      -- Nightbane Vile Fang
  kill 920 quest 222                      -- Nightbane Tainted One

step Darkshire
  turnin 177                              -- Viktori Prism'Antras, inside
  accept 181
  turnin 222                              -- Calor
  accept 223
  turnin 223                              -- Jonathan Carevin, by Elaine Carevin's house; inside
  vendor nearest

step Vul'Gol Ogre Mound: kill these as you meet them
  zone Duskwood
  tip Head east to the ogre mound. Abercrombie's Crate sits in the camp at its entrance; Splinter Fist ogres guard it.
  accept 96138 optional                   -- Only if a Lost Watcher dropped Merrick's Bow: right-click it
  kill 212 x8 quest 96138.1 optional      -- Splinter Fist Warrior
  kill 892 x4 quest 96138.2 optional      -- Splinter Fist Taskmaster
  collect 1968 quest 181.1 @38.0,80.0 map 1431 -- Below ground
  collect 1349 quest 134 @33.4,76.3       -- Abercrombie's Crate

step Defias Strongbox
  when onquest 1244
  tip The Defias camp lies in the south-west of Duskwood, south of Raven Hill near the Westfall border. The strongbox stands among the tents.
  collect 5947 quest 1244 @23.9,72.1      -- Defias Docket; inside

step Abercrombie
  turnin 134
  accept 160

step Raven Hill Cemetery: kill these as you meet them
  zone Duskwood
  tip The Plague Spreaders walk the northern half of the Raven Hill Cemetery. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.
  tip Skeletal Raiders, Healers and Warders hold the west part of the cemetery, just east of Sven's camp.
  tip Careful: The skeletons in the catacombs are packed close together, so you can easily pull extra mobs.
  kill 604 quest 58                       -- Plague Spreader
  kill 785 quest 323                      -- Skeletal Warder
  kill 1110 quest 323                     -- Skeletal Raider
  kill 787 quest 323                      -- Skeletal Healer

