step The Lost Fleet: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip Follow the coast north to the wrecked ship. Cursed Sailors walk the beach, Cursed Marines the deck; First Mate Snellig stands on the beach by the bow. Giant Wetlands Crocolisks lurk on the coast just north of it.
  tip Careful: Fen Creepers hide in stealth where the river splits close to the ghost ship, and they can join a fight.
  kill 1158 quest 289                     -- Cursed Marine
  kill 1157 quest 289                     -- Cursed Sailor
  collect 3619 quest 289                  -- Snellig's Snuffbox: First Mate Snellig
  collect 3348 quest 471                  -- Giant Crocolisk Skin

step Menethil Harbor
  turnin 289                              -- First Mate Fitzsimmons
  accept 290
  turnin 471                              -- James Halloran
  accept 98072
  vendor nearest

step Captain Halyndor
  tip The captain walks the deck of the wrecked ship; his strongbox sits in the hold.
  collect 2629 quest 290                  -- Intrepid Strongbox Key
  turnin 290                              -- Intrepid's Locked Strongbox
  accept 292

step On the way
  along until q299
  collect 2658 quest 299 -- Ados Fragment along the way to Ormer and Whelgar
  collect 2659 quest 299 -- Modr Fragment along the way to Ormer and Whelgar
  collect 2660 quest 299 -- Golm Fragment along the way to Ormer and Whelgar
  collect 2661 quest 299 -- Neru Fragment along the way to Ormer and Whelgar

step Whelgar's Excavation Site: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip The relics lie in the dig itself. Sarltooth, a big Razormaw, prowls the raptor valley just west of it.
  tip The Dragonmaw orcs camp east of the excavation site. Raiders and Swamprunners carry the war banners.
  collect 3337 quest 464                  -- Dragonmaw War Banner
  collect 3638 quest 296                  -- Sarltooth's Talon

