step Goaz Warder
  tip The Goaz Warders stand just west of Whelgar's camp: use the Goaz Stone he gave you beside one.
  collect 279993 quest 98216.1            -- Titanic Keystone

step Prospector Whelgar
  turnin 98216                            -- Below ground
  accept 98310                            -- A new Goaz Stone, for the four titan watchers around the Wetlands, in Group 12; below ground

