step Angerfang Encampment
  tip Head east again to the Dragonmaw camp. The four sets of Attack Plans lie in the Angerfang Encampment; Chieftain Nek'rosh, an elite, stands in the camp too.
  complete 98221 @53.5,54.5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thousand Needles

step To Theramore
  turnin 98221                            -- Captain Stoutfist, in Menethil Keep; on the top floor
  accept 465                              -- For the Dragonmaw catapult, on the Wetlands loop of the next guide
  note Take the boat from Menethil's pier to Theramore Isle in Dustwallow Marsh.

step Boat to Theramore
  zone Wetlands
  goto 5.13,63.61 "Boat to Theramore"

step Into The Barrens
  zone The Barrens
  goto 49.5,78.4 "Into The Barrens"

step Takar the Seer
  only Warlock
  zone The Barrens
  tip On the road south through the Barrens, Takar the Seer camps east of the road, north-east of Camp Taurajo; come in from the east and keep clear of the Horde guards.
  turnin 1716                             -- Takar the Seer
  accept 1738                             -- Heartswood: in Ashenvale, on the way to Desolace
  accept 65602 optional                   -- What Is Love?: the incubus, beside the succubus; the Wooden Figurine is near the Heartswood

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: Razorfen Kraul, optional, asked once (`when group 1144`). Its entrance
# (the Barrens 42.9,90.2, Dungeons codex) lies by the road down to Thousand Needles that this
# guide takes. Its two Alliance quests start inside: Willix the Importer (1144, escort, given
# and handed in by Willix) and Mortality Wanes (1142, from Heralath Fallowbrook, for Treshala
# Fallowbrook in Darnassus: handed in on the Darnassus detour of Group 14). No prerequisite for
# either (Polestar's Forever data and the TrinityCore Forever world base). Left out: Blueleaf
# Tubers (Ratchet, off the route), The Crone of the Kraul (after Lonebrow's Journal, Feralas,
# level 29), class quests (Fire Hardened Mail, Warrior; Elemental Aid, Shaman, Forever).
# Boss order from the codex; places inside from Warcraft Tavern's and Icy Veins' Forever guides
# (12/11/2026): Heralath and Willix by a tent below Charlga's area, so both quests are taken at the
# end and the escort walks back to the entrance.
step Razorfen Kraul (dungeon, optional)
  label rfk-start
  when group 1144
  when level<33
  zone The Barrens
  tip Razorfen Kraul: a 5-player quilboar dungeon in the bramble at the southern edge of the Barrens, west of the road down to Thousand Needles, levels 25 to 33 (29 to 38 in the group finder; the last bosses are 33): at 29 or more here, it goes well. Its two Alliance quests are given inside: nothing to take beforehand. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on to Thousand Needles.
  note Horde land: keep clear of Camp Taurajo and its guards. Keep 2 free quest log slots.
  goto 42.9,90.2 "Razorfen Kraul" r 25

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0 (review): the two class quests of the codex for this dungeon, only for
# the class and only for whoever holds the quest. Drops from Polestar's Forever data: Vial of
# Phlogiston (Roogug, 100 %; Warcraft Tavern's Forever guide, 11/11/2026, says the same), Tattered
# Note (Charlga Razorflank, rate unknown: to check in game).
step Warriors: Fire Hardened Mail
  only Warrior
  when done rfk-start
  when onquest 1701
  along until rfk-charlga
  tip Roogug, the first boss, drops the Vial of Phlogiston. The other items of the quest come from Stonetalon and the Wetlands: Polestar's class guides (Fire Hardened Armor) cover them.
  collect 6841 quest 1701                 -- Vial of Phlogiston: Roogug

step Razorfen Kraul: Charlga Razorflank
  label rfk-charlga
  when group 1144
  when done rfk-start
  tip Roogug, Aggem Thorncurse, Death Speaker Jargba, Overlord Ramtusk and Agathelos the Raging come before her (the codex's order). Charlga, the last boss, fights on the ramp outside her hut and teleports back into it now and then: the tank grabs her again. Her Purity dispels every debuff and makes her immune for a while: no damage-over-time on her.
  kill 4421                               -- Charlga Razorflank

step Shamans: Elemental Aid
  only Shaman
  when done rfk-start
  when onquest 96264
  tip Elemental Aid (Veyric Thunderhame, Arathi Highlands): the Tattered Note comes from Charlga Razorflank. To check in game: the drop rate is not known.
  collect 274463 quest 96264              -- Tattered Note: Charlga Razorflank

step Razorfen Kraul: Heralath Fallowbrook
  when group 1144
  when done rfk-start
  tip Jump down from Charlga's area and kill a few quilboars: Heralath Fallowbrook, a night elf who died in the Kraul, lies by a tent in the north of that area. Mortality Wanes asks for Treshala's Pendant, about 1 quilboar in 10, for each player on the quest: by now most of the Kraul is cleared, so it often takes the walk back or a second run.
  accept 1142                             -- Heralath Fallowbrook
  collect 5825 quest 1142 optional        -- Treshala's Pendant: quilboars of the Kraul, about 1 in 10

step Razorfen Kraul: Willix the Importer
  when group 1144
  when done rfk-start
  tip Willix the Importer, a goblin, is held in the same tent as Heralath. Everyone takes his quest before he starts walking; he walks back to the entrance by the south side, past many armored boars. He gives the reward himself at the end.
  note Not there? Another group is escorting him: wait for him to come back, or join them.
  accept 1144                             -- Willix the Importer
  complete 1144                           -- Escort him out of the Kraul
  turnin 1144                             -- Willix the Importer, at the entrance

step Thousand Needles
  zone Thousand Needles
  goto 46.9,48.5 "Thousand Needles"

step Thousand Needles
  zone Thousand Needles
  goto 77.8,77.3 "Thousand Needles"

step Mirage Raceway
  tip Follow the canyons east to the salt flats. The goblins and gnomes of the Mirage Raceway are neutral and give quests to both factions.
  accept 5762                             -- For Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn, later
  accept 1110                             -- Kravel Koalbeard
  accept 1104                             -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  turnin 1179                             -- Wizzle Brassbolts

step Mirage Raceway: kill these as you meet them
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats. Scorpid Reavers roam the north half; keep to it, away from the Saltstone Basilisks, Crystalhides and Gazers (32-35) of the middle and the far south.
  collect 5794 quest 1104                 -- Salty Scorpid Venom
  collect 5798 quest 1110                 -- Rocket Car Parts

step Mirage Raceway
  turnin 1110                             -- Kravel Koalbeard
  turnin 1104                             -- Fizzle Brassbolts
  accept 1106 optional                    -- Fizzle Brassbolts: for Martek in the Badlands, at 39; not offered? Go on

